# Sorcery of the North (sandoria 83) accepted by GM, no tome, at the Fei'Yin chest: the trade's exactness is
# xi.treasure.onTrade's (the quest's call passes the trade through): the key and a bone chip (two items) and a bone chip
# alone are refused (CHEST_UNLOCKED + 7, the key named; nothing taken); the key alone opens the chest (the tome 2 s
# later). A trade of the key with the tome then held is the chest's own (the quest's nil): the chest is open (opened
# 1 for 5 s): CHEST_UNLOCKED - 7.
char zone=Feiyin pos=168.7,-24.0,210.8 job=WAR lvl=50
quest Sandoria.SorceryOfTheNorth accepted
item FeiyinChestKey x2
item BoneChip
login
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Chest                    # the chest's own trigger
trade Treasure_Chest FeiyinChestKey x1 BoneChip x1  # the key and a chip: refused
trade Treasure_Chest BoneChip x1          # a chip: refused
trade Treasure_Chest FeiyinChestKey x1    # the key: the chest opens
tick 2500                                 # the Fei'Yin Magic Tome
trade Treasure_Chest FeiyinChestKey x1    # the tome held: the chest's own script; open: CHEST_UNLOCKED - 7
tick 2000
